Package: carborewind-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: CarboRewind maintainers <noreply@github.com>
Depends: adduser, util-linux, ca-certificates
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/hooo86/CarboRewind
Description: CarboRewind backup agent for Carbonio mail servers
 Hot, point-in-time backups of Carbonio CE mailboxes into an encrypted,
 deduplicated repository, driven by the CarboRewind server over mutual TLS.
 Ships its own Python runtime under /opt/carborewind-agent.
